                          <input type="text" class="tag-input flex-1 min-w-[80px] text-xs outline-none placeholder:text-[#a1a1aa] bg-transparent text-[#18181b]" placeholder="Masukan keyword...">
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-[#71717a] leading-normal">
                          *Ketik kata kunci lalu tekan <b>Enter</b>. Jika dinonaktifkan, balasan dikirim jika komentar mengandung salah satu kata kunci.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- VIEW 2: KEYWORD MODE -->
                <div class="dm-view-section dm-view-keyword hidden space-y-3">
                  <div class="p-3 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e7] rounded-lg text-xs text-[#71717a] flex gap-2 font-medium shadow-2xs">
                    <i class="ti ti-info-circle text-[15px] text-[#18181b] shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
                    <span>Biarkan kolom "Masukan keyword" kosong untuk digunakan sebagai balasan default</span>
                  </div>
                  
                  <div class="dm-keywords-list space-y-3">
